  "question": {
    "text": "The co-ordinates of a moving particle at any time ' $t$ ' are given by $x=\\alpha t^3$ and $y=\\beta t^3$. The speed of the particle at time ' $t$ ' is given by",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "PM0OC",
      "text": "\n$3 t \\sqrt{\\alpha^2+\\beta^2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sIScN",
      "text": "\n$3 t^2 \\sqrt{\\alpha^2+\\beta^2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "K9Wz7",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{t}^2 \\sqrt{\\alpha^2+\\beta^2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "BM2Rz",
      "text": "\n$\\sqrt{\\alpha^2+\\beta^2}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$V_x=\\frac{d x}{d t}=3 \\alpha t^2, V_y=\\frac{d y}{d t}=3 \\beta t^2$\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}=\\sqrt{\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{x}^2}+\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{y}^2}}=3 \\mathrm{t}^2 \\sqrt{\\alpha^2+\\beta^2}$",
    "image": null
  },
